    "all_native_blocks_byte_exact": true,
    "scope": "Prove exactly Theorem2.10: over an arbitrary field, a finite simple graphic arrangement is MAT-free exactly when its graph is strongly chordal. Every new MAT-labeling restriction/maximal-edge/sun-exclusion argument, MAT-simplicial/PEO and complete-clique extension/merge proof, crown-free antichain leaf argument and full compatible-clique-poset construction and global gluing remains required core. There is one characterized class, no separate supporting lemma or parameter count.",
    "prerequisites": "Named multiple addition/freeness facts, classical chordal graph/separator facts and the cited Nevries--Rosenke crown-free clique-intersection characterization are explicit ordinary prerequisites. The authors state them with intact hypotheses below. The entire new MAT-labeling and compatibility construction is included, not granted.",
    "literal_source_interfaces": "Literal source descriptions are retained: the gluing proof has N_G(v_ell) subset E_G[A] at1072, and the complete-clique merge proof at1030--1033 lists the printed comparison cases. No vertex/edge replacement, added case or generated proof is inserted. Full preceding MAT-simplicial bounds, complete-clique recipes and full subsequent gluing are supplied for source review.",
    "formatting": "Complete exact native142--1224 and the original two-panel Figure7 at1400--1438 are retained in author order. Original unused ytableau import is omitted because its active diagrams occur only in omitted unselected exponent-growth examples. Every needed graph/poset and all mathematical labels remain native inline TikZ, using genuine installed tikz-cd/tkz-graph/braket/subcaption. Original graph/path labels, author comments and percent newline guards are unchanged. The unselected introduction, final illustrative exponent-growth examples and open problems are omitted. The later Figure7 referenced by the complete-clique remark is retained with its exact original index, without the unavailable unselected tableaux. No publisher class, private preamble or external asset is executed.",
    "prepared_at": "2026-10-03T02:39:51.004158+00:00",
